    "id": "crashcourse:test",
    "title": "Optional Advanced Test · full response",
    "chapter": "Crashcourse – Advanced Test",
    "prompt": "In class: use the remaining 55 min across the workshop for peer review and redrafting. Afterwards, attempt the optional 120-minute practice paper below without opening the scaffolds. This is training, not the actual exam on 6 November.",
